
!! cmavo: ca'u (FAHA2)

!!! Proposed Definition
In front of, forwards, to the front of.  Indicates that something is to the front of the speaker.  When tagging a sumti, indicates that the relation described by the bridi in question is north of the tagged sumti.

!!! Proposed Tag
farna tcita (provisional)

!!! See Also
* {XYY}
* {XYZ}
* {GISMU}

!!! Proposed Keywords
* whatever
* shyeah-right!

!!! Usage Examples
;xxx mi klama:"Whatever!  I'm going."

!!! Notes
This cmavo is different from {XYY}, because {XYY} allows for the piano-eating duties to be split.

!!! Issues
This cmavo is completely non-standard, but ''very'' common
in actual usage.  We could resolve this by allowing it, or not.

...

!! General Section Issues

All attitudinal modifiers are weird.

